anemll-embeddinggemma-2-ane

This repository contains Core AI packages converted from Google's
EmbeddingGemma 2 model weights, plus a slim host/ folder for inference:

  Base model: google/embeddinggemma-2
  https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2
  Revision used for conversion: 914f7f89142e33e77833254d9c9b90c3cef7303b
  Authors: Google DeepMind

The model weights in this repository are a modified (converted) form of the
base model and are distributed under the same terms as the base model: the
Apache License, Version 2.0, as published by Google for Gemma at
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license (full text in LICENSE).

Modifications by Anemll: conversion of the vision, audio, and text towers to
Apple Core AI (.aimodel) packages in float16, with graph rewrites for the
Apple Neural Engine (explicit attention instead of fused SDPA, fp16-safe
RMSNorm, precomputed relative-position keys, fixed sequence lengths). No
retraining or fine-tuning was performed.

The host/ folder redistributes the tokenizer, processor / preprocessor
configs, and config.json as unmodified (byte-identical) copies of the
upstream files at the revision above. The embedding table
(host/embed_tokens.safetensors) is the exception: it is extracted from
upstream model.safetensors (language_model.embed_tokens.weight) and is not
a full-weights copy. See host/SOURCE.md for per-file origin and checksums.

Use of the model must also follow the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy, as stated
in the base model card: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy

The conversion and runtime code (https://github.com/Anemll/anemll-embeddings)
is separate software licensed under the MIT License. It is not covered by
this repository's LICENSE.

This is an unofficial conversion. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Google.
